1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,850
Blood.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,850
Power.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,850
Control.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,850
Destiny.

5
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:11,700
I thought it would set me free.

6
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:14,800
A life beyond mortality.

7
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,800
Decades have passed.

8
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:23,700
Only now have I been allowed
to return to my city.

9
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:27,700
Everything I knew is gone.

10
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:31,000
My master still sees me as a child.

11
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:32,450
Inexperienced.

12
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:33,850
Worthless.

13
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,850
Blood.

14
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,850
Weakness.

15
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,850
Dependence.

16
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,850
Punishment.

17
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:44,800
Night after night.

18
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:48,650
Here we go again.